** is a immersive video player built for cinematic media playback in VR. Enjoy your local, USB, and network media with high-quality rendering, powerful format support, and intuitive hands-free controls.\n\n# Features\n\n- Powerful playback engine with support for 8K VR video, AV1, and common media formats\n- Supports 2D, 3D, 180\u00b0, and 360\u00b0 video formats\n- Ambient lighting around the video panel for a more immersive viewing experience\n- Hand tracking and micro-gesture controls for media navigation\n- High-resolution UI designed for exceptional clarity and readability\n- USB storage support, including exFAT and NTFS drives\n- SMB and WebDAV network storage support\n- Advanced subtitle rendering with extensive customization options\n- External subtitle support\n- Video chapters support\n- HDR and Dolby Vision support\n- Passthrough mode with passthrough dimming\n- Multiple curved panel options for comfortable viewing\n- Optimized startup performance\n\n###\n\n\n# Coming Soon\n\n- Environments\n- Fisheye and frame-sequential 3D support\n- DLNA and FTP storage support\n- ISO playback support\n- Cloud storage support\n", "short_description": "Emei VR Video Player is an immersive VR player for playing local, USB, and network media. It supports 8K VR, AV1 and all other common video formats/codecs, 2D/3D, 180\u00b0/360\u00b0, HDR/Dolby Vision. It features advanced/external subtitles, USB exFAT/NTFS support, SMB/WebDAV, passthrough dimming, ambient lighting, curved panels, high-res UI, video chapters, hand tracking, micro-gesture controls, and fast startup. Coming soon: environments, fisheye/frame-sequential 3D, DLNA/FTP, ISO, and cloud storages."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://emeivr.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KJapps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://emeivr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_categor